acing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Deceased<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC25&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC25-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alias\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alias(es)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Big Gary Slaughter<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC18&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC18-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Mask\" title=\"Azure Mask\">Azure Mask</a> for the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a><br />Computer Technician and Farmer</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Murdered by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC25&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC25-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Order of St. George</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"house\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">House</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mask\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mask</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Azure Mask\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/1/13/Azure_Mask.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20241130215647\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Azure Mask.png\" data-image-key=\"Azure_Mask.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span> — <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Mask\" title=\"Azure Mask\">Azure</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"position\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Position</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Retired<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC23&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC23-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica Slaughter</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li>Unnamed dogs (pets)</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #18</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #25</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">I'm doing it because it was shit how they dealt with <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a> and it's shit how they handled <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">you</a>. And because retirement is boring as fuck.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Gary Slaughter , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #23</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Gary Slaughter</b>, nicknamed <b>\"Big Gary\"</b>, was an <a href=\"/wiki/Azure_Mask\" title=\"Azure Mask\">Azure Mask</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> under <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>. Serving as a hacker and farmer of training <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monsters</a>, Gary was a close friend of <a href=\"/wiki/Jessica_Slaughter\" title=\"Jessica Slaughter\">Jessica</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a>, the working partner of <a href=\"/wiki/Buck_Slaughter\" title=\"Buck Slaughter\">Buck Slaughter</a>, and a beloved figure among many trainees of the House of Slaughter. After helping <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> evade the House and continue to hunt monsters, he was interrogated and killed by <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte_Cutter\" title=\"Charlotte Cutter\">Charlotte Cutter</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Physical_appearance\">Physical appearance</span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><i>TBA</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_18\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 18\">Issue #18</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_20\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 20\">20</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_23\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 23\">Issue #23</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\">Issue #25</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"aed720834377d26b290fdc32ef2dd079\" data-seq-n